# Work-specific skills (sensitive, symlinked from 1Password via symlinks.sh)
skills/argocd
skills/astro
skills/bastion_zero
skills/lrl-cli
skills/observe
skills/signadot
skills/spacectl
skills/prod-release
skills/prod-version
skills/notion-research-documentation

!assets/
!assets/**
